# Closure tests of a callee that is one of two functions and of an expected callee pass the back-end checks in compact code
# RUN: compile
# OPTIONS: heat=everything-is-cold validate check=validate-back-end
# STATISTIC: CallsResolved >= 1
# STATISTIC: CallsGuarded >= 1
# STATISTIC: TestAndBranchGroups >= 2
# CHECK: image not empty
# PROGRAM-OF: fast.ir
